  "name": "CFS Total Scoring",
  "status": "validated",
  "description": "Cognitive Flexibility Scale (CFS). Total = sum of the 12 items (each 1-6), range 12-72. Higher scores indicate greater cognitive flexibility (reverse-keyed items are reversed by the runtime). No standard severity cut-offs.",
